      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "- plywood panel consisting of an assembly of veneer sheets with at least one outer ply of non-coniferous wood other than tropical bonded together with the direction of the grain in alternate plies generally at right angles. The veneer sheets are usually placed symmetrically on both sides of a central ply or core that may itself be made from a veneer sheet or another material. It includes veneer plywood, core plywood or blockboard, cellular board and composite plywood. It excludes laminated construction materials (e.g. glulam), where the grain of the veneer sheets generally runs in the same direction.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "由单板层组装而成的胶合板板材，至少一层表层为非热带的阔叶材，且相邻单板层的纹理方向通常相互垂直。单板层一般在中央层或芯层两侧对称排列，中央层或芯层可由单板或其他材料制成。包括单板胶合板、芯板胶合板或木芯板、蜂窝板和复合胶合板。不包括层压结构材料（如胶合木 glulam），其单板纹理方向通常基本一致。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
